<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends steady against dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends steady against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed steady at 42.2370/42.2480 to the dollar in interbank trading compared with the previous 42.2380/42.2480, dealers said.</p>
<p>Dealers said the taka eased as demand for dollars picked up slightly for import payments after opening firmer at 42.2350/42.2450.</p>
<p>Dealers said interbank call money rates closed unchanged at 3.75 percent to 4.25 percent.</p>
</text>
